  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Forest Guard / Wildlife Guard Medical Admit Card 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-09T14:51:20+05:30\">June 9, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:51 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://upsssc.gov.in/\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>Medical Admit Card </strong>on its&nbsp;<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Forest Guard&nbsp;Examination 2025.</strong> The Medical Exam will be conducted on<strong> 15 June 2026</strong>, and&nbsp; the last date to submit the application form was <strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">10 October 2023</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Medical Admit Card</strong>&nbsp;using&nbsp;their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the <strong>portal. The direct link</strong> is provided below. <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt No. : 10/2023)</strong></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Forest Guard / Wildlife Guard Medical Admit Card 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Forest Guard Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsssc-forest-guard-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Start Date<strong> : 20 September 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>10 October 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>10 October 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date<strong> : 17 October 2023</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>09 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>30 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>06 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Answer Key : </span><strong>10 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Result Date : </span><strong>08 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PET / PMT Date :<strong> 10 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PET Result : <strong>30 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Exam Date : 15 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>09 June 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>UPSSSC</b>&nbsp;official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">For All Candidates : ₹ 25/-</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Forest Guard Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2023</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Year</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPSSSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Forest Guard&nbsp;</strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">709 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Forest Guard Recruitment 2023 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.2034%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.0151%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Forest Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.2034%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">693</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 60.0151%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"97\">passed the UPSSSC PET 2022 exam</strong>&nbsp;and should be&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"149\">12th pass from a recognized board</strong>.<br>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.7814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Wild Life Guard</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.2034%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">16</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsssc-draftsman-cartographer-exam-date-2025/\"><strong>UPSSSC Draftsman &amp; Cartographer Exam Date 2025</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download UPSSSC Forest Guard Medical Admit Card 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"230\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong>official website</strong> of</span><br data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"185\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibh2et\" data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"288\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on the <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"278\">“Admit Card”</strong> section</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j03yig\" data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"354\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Find and click on</span><br data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"313\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"354\">“Forest Guard Medical Admit Card 2026”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ghk9lf\" data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"399\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Exam Date will open in <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"397\">PDF format</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1irqa76\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"465\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Press <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"422\">Ctrl + F</strong> and search your:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"465\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1cb4ou\" data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"465\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Roll Number / Name</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hs9rtr\" data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"518\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">If your details appear → <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"516\">You are qualified</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dz5t2i\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"575\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download and <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"558\">save/print the PDF</strong> for future use</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;UPSSSC Forest Guard Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>PET / PST</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>DV, Medical Test</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our Telegram Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color